      "description": "Star Wars Tribes RPG by Hazor and team - an RPG mod set in the Star Wars universe, built on the Star Wars TC 2.0 art and sounds: skins, models, terrain and scripts. v2 adds the recovered Tatooine server mission, so you can host the real map locally, plus 8 recovered robe and armor skins. Launch with -mod SWRPG or use the toggle below.",
